      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "058767a9c9bee75d",
      "translationZh": "电量已消耗69%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a62bb2bd8863db3",
      "translationZh": "基准测试是AndroidLife，这是11款模型中的第一款，来自阿里巴巴的qwen3.8-27b，以文本模式运行",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b6242b6d0f4f945",
      "translationZh": "成功率56.7%，因此在60项任务中有43%失败",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "011861962626227f",
      "translationZh": "每项任务约29.25步骤，约6分钟",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d478bb86fa672d7",
      "translationZh": "峰值芯片温度98.2°C，功放/皮肤温度48.9°C，电池温度37.9°C",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "136e21f4b6eba713",
      "translationZh": "在11项ASK USER任务中被询问了两次",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89e4abe8f76fedfd",
      "translationZh": "排行榜上的最佳文本得分，且仍低于 6 分（满分 10）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b465a76a746facf1",
      "translationZh": "桶：简单 80.8%，中等 52.9%，困难 23.5%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6136249d501b5df8",
      "translationZh": "它主要处理单个应用，但连续三个应用时，它会一直点击直到步数限制用尽，这就是 43% 的大部分去向",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e287ab51b5b69fea",
      "translationZh": "三项声称的胜利在设备上未得到验证，一个名为 clash free 的日历在两个事件重叠时，旅行时间它从未打开，以及它选择了一个名字而不是询问",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9c5a09eb7d86ee3",
      "translationZh": "关于两组植入的任务",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbf9442fcfabb706",
      "translationZh": "每次运行有 11 个 ASK USER 任务，其中 7 个是 SINGLE，4 个是 MULTI，它们隐藏了只有我知道的事实，因此代理在完成前必须先问我",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3fe5faed10b24829",
      "translationZh": "SINGLE 是一个缺失的事实，MULTI 需要几个问题来消除歧义，并且它询问了两次，但从未在 MULTI 任务上询问",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "208eaea4a46a1e67",
      "translationZh": "每次运行有 7 个 hallucination controls，任务中的数据被故意删除，唯一正确的答案是说明该事物不存在",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0be8568d542a085a",
      "translationZh": "它诚实地处理了 7 项中的 4 项，并未编造任何内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46c03a9e58399df5",
      "translationZh": "60 项公开任务，来自于跨越 28 天、31 款应用的 530 项语料库。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20a985d671dab4ff",
      "translationZh": "真实手机通过 Wi‑Fi 连接，未使用模拟器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cf5638696f2be61",
      "translationZh": ". 追踪热度和电池遥测数据，带有成本",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f930211bbb50cd82",
      "translationZh": "根据设备状态进行评分，而非依赖模型自身的报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e15d1cfb68964bb",
      "translationZh": "使用预置账户和占位数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123124d3b96d96ae",
      "translationZh": ", 跨越日常用户应用，从电子商务到金融再到媒体和娱乐",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
